    {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "In my first venture into Europe, I spent a week by the Amsterdam canals, admiring the quaint architecture and seeking out signs of Miffy. We ran through a whole ring of museums — the Anne Frank House, Rijksmuseum, Stedelijk, and the Moco — with evenings carried by escape rooms, karaoke, and bitterballen."
    },
